		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Vigi iC60 add-on residual current device, 3P, 25 A, 30 mA, type AC</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Add-on residual current device Vigi iC60, 3P, 25 A, 30 mA, type AC, instantaneous, 400-415 V AC, for iC60. Width 6 x 9 mm (54 mm), height 91 mm, depth 73.5 mm. Discontinued 23 Sept 2025, not replaced. Mounted next to an iC60: its own terminals are drawn.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
